This is more for future reference than anything (I was forced to kill my
poor pet because he kept enveloping me when I was trying to get to
Stormbringer so I could kill a green dragon), but is there a way to tame
a pet that has been polymorphed into something like an ice vortex?  It
ignored the tripe rations I tossed at it, which didn't really suprise
me.  I guess it would be nice to have a pet ice vortex...

While I'm here, on a completely different subject...I was wondering if
there's any reason that the Amiga version of nethack doesn't employ
segmented code.  I hope the dev team is working on this, because it
would make as much if not more sense to have segmented code on the
Amiga, making the program lots easier to run on low-end machines and
lots easier to multitask with on all machines, than the overlay code on
the MS-DOS version.  Also, how come nethack won't find the hack.font?
I've resorted to loading it via setfont before playing...


